teather (0.1.0-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Tune the UDP gateway for bursty low-latency apps such as cloud gaming:
    --udpgw-connections 16 (keep more gateway streams warm) and --udp-timeout
    30 (keep quieter control flows alive). udpgw still frames UDP over a TCP
    stream per flow, so a single high-rate media stream is still subject to
    that stream's head-of-line blocking.

