teather (0.1.0-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Raise the relay concurrency ceiling from 64 to 256 flows (tun2proxy
    --max-sessions and the phone-side SOCKS server). The 2026-08-30 live test
    hit the old limit repeatedly under a full-desktop failover; long-lived
    udpgw streams also consume a slot each.

